quran[19]{c,v,t}:
  38,43,"And We gave (back to) him his family, with many more like them, as a mercy from Us and a lesson for people of reason."
  38,44,"(And We told him:) ‘Take a small bunch of green kindling in your hand, strike (your wife) with it and do not break your oath.’ Indeed, We found him patient. What an excellent servant (he was)! Indeed, he was persistently repentant."
  38,45,"And remember Our servants Ibrahim (Abraham), Ishaq (Isaac) and Ya‘qub (Jacob)—men of (spiritual) power and vision."
  38,46,We purified them with the exclusiveness of the remembrance of the (final) abode.
  38,47,"And in Our sight, they are among the elect of the best."
  38,48,"And remember Isma‘il (Ishmael), al-Yasa‘ (Elisha) and Dhu al-Kifl (Ezekiel). Each (of them) was among the elect."
  38,49,"This is a Reminder. And indeed, for all the God-conscious, there will be an honourable destination:"
  38,50,"The Gardens of Eternity, whose gates will remain wide open for them."
  38,51,"(They will be) comfortably reclining there (on couches), calling for abundant fruits and drinks."
  38,52,"And with them will be (their) spouses, with modest gazes, well-matched in age."
  38,53,This is what you are promised for the Day of Reckoning.
  38,54,"This is indeed Our provision, which will never be exhausted."
  38,55,"This (is for the righteous). As for the rebellious, there shall be the worst destination."
  38,56,"(That is) Hell, where they shall enter (to burn). What an evil place to stay!"
  38,57,"This (is the punishment). Let them taste it: boiling liquid and murky pus fluid,"
  38,58,and other kinds (of punishment) resembling in nature.
  38,59,(The guards of Hell or the inmates will say:) ‘Here is another crowd of people rushing into Hell along with you. There is no welcome for them. They will also burn in the Fire.’
  38,60,They will say: ‘No! You are not welcome. It is you who prepared (this Hell) for us. What an evil abode!’
  38,61,"They will say (adding): ‘Our Lord! Whoever has prepared this for us, double his punishment in the Fire.’"
